  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6cb4028ff2cc77e478bbb362e91e66cd, type: 2}
    text: 'Hiii

      It''s you again!!!'
    autoProgress: 1
    autoProgressDuration: 1.25
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6cb4028ff2cc77e478bbb362e91e66cd, type: 2}
    text: 'Did you see that??

      I beat that chicken demon!!!'
    autoProgress: 1
    autoProgressDuration: 1.25
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6cb4028ff2cc77e478bbb362e91e66cd, type: 2}
    text: 'And I found the first letter he gave me too. '
    autoProgress: 1
    autoProgressDuration: 1.25
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 757e9fef7d0d72640b1ce91c5a603167, type: 2}
    text: 'You must not focus on the letter or those memories...

'
    autoProgress: 1
    autoProgressDuration: 1.25
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 757e9fef7d0d72640b1ce91c5a603167, type: 2}
    text: Focus on getting rid of the demons.
    autoProgress: 1
    autoProgressDuration: 1.25
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 757e9fef7d0d72640b1ce91c5a603167, type: 2}
    text: This is a memory of a movie you guys went to...
